<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Nov oil output falls to 83,000 T.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Nov oil output falls to 83,000 T.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV CRUDE PETROLEUM	NOV	  OCT	 NOV 1995</p>
<p> crude petroleum (tonnes)     83,000     89,000	87,000</p>
<p> natural gas (million cu.meters)    60	   63	    86</p>
<p>-- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom ++381 11 222 4254</p>
</text>
